{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27790","headline":"荅李昌期 · 杨洵美","name":"荅李昌期","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三山载羣仙，峨峨咸浪中。\n云衣剪不得，此路安可从。\n我生亦何事，出门如飞蓬。\n白日又黄昏，所悲瑶草空。\n虫声故乡梦，枕上禾黍风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨洵美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}